{
  "title": "Voice POC",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "A test module. It",
        "makes no sound.",
        "",
        "It exists to declare",
        "a performance",
        "surface, so the",
        "pad_layout and",
        "voices contract has",
        "a real consumer to",
        "check against.",
        "",
        "Load it in a slot",
        "and open its knob",
        "grid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What it declares",
      "lines": [
        "pad_layout: drums.",
        "",
        "Three sibling",
        "voices, each with",
        "its own page:",
        "Kick 36, Snare 38,",
        "Hat 42.",
        "",
        "One page that is",
        "NOT a voice:",
        "Reverb. It has no",
        "note, so it sounds",
        "nothing.",
        "",
        "A rack of four:",
        "Tom Lo, Tom Hi,",
        "Rim, Clap, from",
        "note 60."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Focus",
      "lines": [
        "It owns its focus",
        "through focus_param",
        "cur_voice, whose",
        "value is a LEVEL",
        "NAME.",
        "",
        "Playing 36, 38 or",
        "42 moves it, and",
        "the grid follows.",
        "",
        "Because it declares",
        "a focus param, the",
        "last_note fallback",
        "is never read for",
        "it - exactly one",
        "input is live."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "It never lights a",
        "pad.",
        "",
        "Move owns the pad",
        "LEDs while the",
        "shadow UI is up.",
        "The follow path",
        "reads a param and",
        "navigates, and",
        "emits no MIDI at",
        "all."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
